    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The Board&quot; of Frelgium Water Co. has just acquired a AAA gaming wing under the direction of your aunt Tara, and your dad thinks this is a good opportunity for you to &quot;gain some valuable experience.&quot; Your first day as a game studio CEO starts now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That means your partying days are over, so get up, take some aspirin, and try to wash the stink of booze off your breath. First order of business: Cut costs, increase income, and meet The Board's Quarterly Profit Goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make Profit to Please The Board</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only goal is to satisfy &quot;The Board&quot; of your parent company so you don\u2019t get fired. If you can\u2019t meet their quarterly profit goal, your run is over. Make it  8 quarters to secure your studio's financial success - and then see what else The Board has in store for you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358040/extras/0a4e9d76d93bde9896b75c6868f66341.avif?t=1754814385\" width=384 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Consult Experts to Get Multipliers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your personal network comprises 100 experts who are the best of the best, and you can unlock more each run. Each one has special abilities that add multipliers to stats like sales, worker productivity, and hype.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358040/extras/fb0ad0ca1b116e715a5a609e98919faa.avif?t=1754814385\" width=384 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Studio</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 studio upgrades let you fine tune your departments and give synergies to your Experts. If you think your studio's looking a bit drab and boring, just invest a few million dollars and see what happens!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358040/extras/0a4c0ab0c11939b0297405fa57e975b9.poster.avif?t=1754814385\" width=322 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358040/extras/0a4c0ab0c11939b0297405fa57e975b9.webm?t=1754814385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358040/extras/0a4c0ab0c11939b0297405fa57e975b9.mp4?t=1754814385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage Events</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't control the games media, but you can control how you react to them. You get to decide whether each random event merits a hiring or firing, which results in unique consequences. Just be careful\u2014your decisions could lead to other events being added to the pool.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358040/extras/6433059c08ff166055490cb08fe7e59a.avif?t=1754814385\" width=384 height=304 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use Consumables Strategically</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 different Favors let you buff certain employees by their department or individually. Manipulate your odds of success with a well-timed purchase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358040/extras/4ed6d9099bc516525e314e61b38f162f.poster.avif?t=1754814385\" width=322 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358040/extras/4ed6d9099bc516525e314e61b38f162f.webm?t=1754814385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358040/extras/4ed6d9099bc516525e314e61b38f162f.mp4?t=1754814385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lose Everything and Start Again</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eventually, you won't be able to keep up with the cycle of infinite profit\u2014that's just the game industry for you! But don't fret, you'll be able to take your golden parachute and get back on your feet in no time. Your next studio awaits, and the network of experts you've unlocked will be there right alongside you.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The Board&quot; of Frelgium Water Co. has just acquired a AAA gaming wing under the direction of your aunt Tara, and your dad thinks this is a good opportunity for you to &quot;gain some valuable experience.&quot; Your first day as a game studio CEO starts now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That means your partying days are over, so get up, take some aspirin, and try to wash the stink of booze off your breath. First order of business: Cut costs, increase income, and meet The Board's Quarterly Profit Goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make Profit to Please The Board</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only goal is to satisfy &quot;The Board&quot; of your parent company so you don\u2019t get fired. If you can\u2019t meet their quarterly profit goal, your run is over. Make it  8 quarters to secure your studio's financial success - and then see what else The Board has in store for you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358040/extras/0a4e9d76d93bde9896b75c6868f66341.avif?t=1754814385\" width=384 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Consult Experts to Get Multipliers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your personal network comprises 100 experts who are the best of the best, and you can unlock more each run. Each one has special abilities that add multipliers to stats like sales, worker productivity, and hype.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam