    "short_description": "The game industry is a roguelike! Your family has just acquired dozens of new game studios, and YOU'RE the nepo baby in charge of running them. Fire people, grow your network, and do whatever it takes to satisfy &quot;The Board&quot; - and that means maximizing profit!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
